# The Book of Bû used in scene 21's zone 6 (fixtures/book21: the sweep's
# save of scene 21 with the book, the game's flag 5 at byte 11, Twinsen
# put in zone 6, SceneStartX, Y, Z 18050 1792 20000 at bytes 270-275,
# and the CD's LBA.CFG). Shift opens the inventory, Right and Down go to
# the book and Return uses it: the prophecy, then the hero's script
# shows the book's picture and its message of the runic stones, after
# which it sets three places of the holomap, each showing the holomap's
# picture. In LBA.EXE the message drops the book's picture, whose time
# it outlasts, and each holomap picture takes a slot of its own, the
# globe turning three times as fast. With the clock given back first the
# book's picture shows after the message, and each new picture taking
# the slot of the one shown, the globe turns as one.

sleep 40
shot menu
key Down Return
sleep 3
key Return
sleep 12
shot start
key Shift_L
sleep 3
shot inventory
key Right
sleep 1
key Down
sleep 1
shot book
key Return
sleep 4
shot message
key space
sleep 3
key space
sleep 3
key space
sleep 3
key space
sleep 3
key space
sleep 3
key space
sleep 3
key space
sleep 3
shot last
key space
sleep 4
shot stones
key space
sleep 3
key space
sleep 3
key space
sleep 0.5
shot pictures
sleep 1
shot pictures2
sleep 4
shot end
